{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108135","id":2628434689,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6cqrsB","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108135","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108135.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108135.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108135","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108135/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108135/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108135/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/2b3501923f070798861068feb7617b5e0b3301cb","number":108135,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"libpng: Update to 1.6.51","user":{"login":"Chubercik","id":37378746,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3Mzc4NzQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37378746?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik","html_url":"https://github.com/Chubercik","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"https://sourceforge.net/projects/libpng/files/libpng16/1.6.51/\r\n\r\n**Changes from version 1.6.48 to version 1.6.49**:\r\n\r\n- Added SIMD-optimized code for the RISC-V Vector Extension (RVV).\r\n- Added various fixes and improvements to the build scripts and to the sample code.\r\n\r\n**Changes from version 1.6.49 to version 1.6.50**:\r\n\r\n- Improved the detection of the RVV Extension on the RISC-V platform.\r\n- Replaced inline ASM with C intrinsics in the RVV code.\r\n- Fixed a decoder defect in which unknown chunks trailing IDAT, set to go through the unknown chunk handler, incorrectly triggered out-of-place IEND errors.\r\n- Fixed the CMake file for cross-platform builds that require `libm`.\r\n\r\n**Changes from version 1.6.50 to version 1.6.51**:\r\n\r\n- Fixed CVE-2025-64505 (moderate severity): Heap buffer overflow in `png_do_quantize` via malformed palette index.\r\n- Fixed CVE-2025-64506 (moderate severity): Heap buffer over-read in `png_write_image_8bit` with 8-bit input and `convert_to_8bit` enabled.\r\n- Fixed CVE-2025-64720 (high severity): Buffer overflow in `png_image_read_composite` via incorrect palette premultiplication.\r\n- Fixed CVE-2025-65018 (high severity): Heap buffer overflow in `png_combine_row` triggered via `png_image_finish_read`.\r\n- Fixed a memory leak in `png_set_quantize`.\r\n- Removed the experimental and incomplete ERROR_NUMBERS code.\r\n- Improved the RISC-V vector extension support; required RVV 1.0 or newer.\r\n- Added GitHub Actions workflows for automated testing.\r\n- Performed various refactorings and cleanups.\r\n\r\n_Listed contributors have been removed to make reading of the above list(s) easier._\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471795,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE3OTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:thirdparty","name":"topic:thirdparty","description":"","color